codex
The cause is now concrete: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<getpid>/exe`; Lean 4.22 hard-codes the latter for application discovery. I’ll use a narrowly scoped preload shim that redirects only that one readlink pattern to `/proc/self/exe`, record the shim and hash, and rerun the unchanged trusted preflight.
